      <activity id="0baff099-30ec-5ac1-a799-5940cb1a5e92" activityNameId="ffc7f29e-8383-5032-bfbd-423c43fc1876" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Battery module packaging, Li-ion</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Battery module packaging, Li-ion
Original LCI reference from Crenna et al (2021). Towards more flexibility and transparency in life cycle inventories for Lithium-ion batteries.; UUID: 1178ba4e-4e1d-3f46-ba15-e15610d94207
This dataset represents 1 kg of Li-ion battery module packaging, including the external enclosure, internal spacers, terminals and electronic components. Li-ion cells are not included in this dataset. This dataset is a copy of the corresponding regional dataset. Production volume was adjusted.
Location: Data for global average battery module packaging.
Technology: Typical module packaging for lithium ion batteries
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1178ba4e-4e1d-3f46-ba15-e15610d94207.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
